<title>CANADA: Corporate Foods Ltd Q3 Sept 7 net rises.</title>
<headline>Corporate Foods Ltd Q3 Sept 7 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter ended Sept. 7</p>
<p>   1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.33		   C$0.24</p>
<p> Net			  7,100		    5,100</p>
<p> Revs		     133,700		  113,100</p>
<p>	   9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.75		   C$0.66</p>
<p> Net			 15,900		   13,900</p>
<p> Revs		     366,800		  325,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Previous quarter ended Sept. 9, 1995.  </p>
<p>Corporate Foods is 69 percent owned by Maple Leaf Foods Inc.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
